Table 4.2. The special-effect duty codes.



  <tt> │ <span weight="bold" foreground="#1a5fb4">Class c        </span> │ <span weight="bold" foreground="#1a5fb4">0  </span> │ <span weight="bold" foreground="#1a5fb4">1  </span> │ <span weight="bold" foreground="#1a5fb4">2  </span> │ <span weight="bold" foreground="#1a5fb4">3 </span> │ <span weight="bold" foreground="#1a5fb4">4 </span> │ <span weight="bold" foreground="#1a5fb4">5 </span> │ <span weight="bold" foreground="#1a5fb4">6</span> │ <span weight="bold" foreground="#1a5fb4">7</span> │ <span weight="bold" foreground="#1a5fb4">8</span> │ <span weight="bold" foreground="#1a5fb4">9  </span> │ </tt>
