  <tt> │               │        │ currently selected actuator. It is updated upon    │ </tt>
  <tt> │               │        │ successful completion of a def_actuator command or │ </tt>
  <tt> │               │        │ a act_getid command.                               │ </tt>
  <tt> │ NReads        │ int    │ This reports the result of any call to the command │ </tt>
